71
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,640
Honey...

72
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:51,360
Whoever's son loses the tennis match,

73
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,360
that family must

74
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,880
