without talking to me first?

83
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,760
Hey, that's not necessary.

84
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,120
Bay beat Sun once.

85
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,320
He'll do it again.

86
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:21,960
Right, Bay?

87
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,320
Hey, you'll win again.

88
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,720
How could I beat him?

89
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:29,400
Hey! Be confident.

90
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,520
You already hate that boy, don't you?

91
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,320
