92
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,480
I don't hate him.

93
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,800
You don't?

94
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,400
It's not that.

95
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:43,400
I mean, Sun's shoulder has healed.

96
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:44,720
So now it'll be harder for me to win.

97
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,480
Just a little harder.

98
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,160
Didn't you tell me,

99
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:54,280
"If I think I can do it, I can do it.
I can do it"?

100
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,560
Oh, no reaction?

101
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,000
I was cheering for you, Bay.

102
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,720
Huh?

103
