109
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,080
It is what it is.

110
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,880
-Going abroad?
-Bay.

111
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:20,280
If you win, which you definitely will

112
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,640
because you've beaten him once,

113
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:24,720
