114
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:36,360
SUPPORTED BY THE DEPARTMENT OF CULTURAL PROMOTION, MINISTRY OF CULTURE

115
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:49,960
Sun!

116
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,200
Sun!

117
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,240
