125
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,040
What are we gonna do?

126
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:19,960
Follow me.

127
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,000
Okay.

128
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,840
Sun, I'm begging you.

129
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:26,400
