131
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:28,760
Huh?

132
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,360
Study abroad?

133
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,280
Yeah.

134
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,680
Because I won the match last time,

135
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,280
