Uh-oh.

165
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,360
Sorry, guys.

166
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,400
Please, go on.

167
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,320
Saturday, Sunday, 
or last Sunday?

168
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,480
Last Friday night.

169
