189
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,640
Just tell me honestly.

190
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,440
No lies.

191
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:37,080
You want to beat Sun, don't you?

192
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,040
Yeah.

193
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,120
I can't lose.

194
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,600
