235
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,520
Hey, where's Mom?

236
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,720
She had to run some errands.

237
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:08,720
She can't be here today.

238
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,080
Oh.

239
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:10,920
But...

240
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:12,920
