241
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,040
See how you're doing after 
getting punched.

242
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,200
She knows about this?

243
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,000
Of course.

244
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:21,040
Boy Excuse me,
who ordered this without carrots?

245
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:21,720
Here.

246
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:23,600
Excuse me. 

247
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,280
Thank you.

248
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:25,720
Thank you.

249
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,360
And...

250
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,120
have you been punished?

251
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,160
Just cleaning the toilets.

252
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:42,320
Good. At least it's not that 
big of a deal.

253
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,720
Are you okay?

254
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,680
Hey, bro.

255
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,720
Actually, there's something 
I haven't told you.

256
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,280
There's a big problem.

257
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,000
You got it, right?

258
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,960
To go up against Sun,
you have to hit the ball that fast.

259
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,040
Even if you can keep up with his shots,

260
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,520
