261
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:41,400
But I don't think Coach Kong assigning you
to doubles is a bad thing.

262
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:44,480
The way you play is actually
better suited for doubles.

263
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,560
Yeah, I did play doubles before.

264
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,880
Eh? Then why did you have such
a problem with it?

265
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:50,800
Just play doubles then.

266
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,000
No way.

267
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,360
Eww, your sweat!

268
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,080
Thanks for the coaching.

269
