enough to get you fired.

274
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:33,800
But since this is your first offense,
your salary will be docked.

275
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:40,280
Umm, can you put these on hold?

276
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,520
