278
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,320
People are trying to get their hands on it.

279
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,600
Please.

280
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,080
Cut me some slack.

281
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,560
Can't you give me a discount?

282
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:53,760
I'll take this one.

283
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:58,800
Boat!

284
