What are you doing here?

285
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,000
It's your money.

286
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,400
So now I don't have to pay you back, right?

287
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,320
Hey, hey, hey.

288
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:33,360
Didn't you borrow my money to buy this?

289
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:38,960
Think of it as your apology
for avoiding me.

290
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:40,880
Hey.

291
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:42,360
Are you really mad?

292
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,040
Huh?

293
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:47,320
I'm being serious.

294
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,800
Just answer me honestly.

295
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:53,480
Where have you been all these years?

296
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,000
Have you really been that busy?

297
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,440
Well... I'm here now.

298
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,080
Why are you so sensitive about it?

299
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,160
Are you really a teacher?

300
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,560
At least your little brother respects me.

301
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,320
He's just being polite.

302
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,080
By the way,

303
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:13,840
you don't look like a doctor at all.

304
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,360
Are you really studying medicine?

305
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,800
Why do you look like...

306
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,880
you don't take care of yourself?

307
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,360
And why did you come to see me?

308
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:27,200
Or did you just come to apologize?

309
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:30,760
Well...

310
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:33,040
there's a big problem.

311
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:50,560
Hey, dude!

312
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,440
Oh! What? What?

313
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,280
Are you going down?

314
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,800
Then why were you shouting?

315
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:01,840
Is it true

316
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:04,520
that your family and Sun's are betting
on the tennis match?

317
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,520
Huh?

318
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:09,720
The whole school is talking.

319
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:11,280
Is it true?

320
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:13,000
Just tell your best friend.

321
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:17,920
What?

322
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:33,080
Who started this rumor?

323
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:38,920
A high school tennis match
has turned into a business bet?

324
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:49,400
If the Principal finds out,
what's gonna happen?

325
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:54,240
I think
we should let the Principal know about this.

326
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:54,880
Huh?

327
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:58,160
No, we should let the students know first.

328
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:10,600
And when the Principal finds out,
she'll call off the match.

329
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,080
What's up, girl?

330
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:13,240
Huh!

331
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,280
Sun and Bay's families?

332
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:18,040
They're putting their dim sum shops 
on a bet?

333
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:19,400
Don't let anyone know

334
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:20,720
that the match will be held at 
the school field

335
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:21,960
on Monday at 6 p.m.

336
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,240
Where did you get this idea?

337
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:27,800
This plan...

338
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,840
I got the idea from an iconic old series.

339
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,560
Is it true?

340
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:41,440
Are your fathers making a bet?

341
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:44,280
PIRUNPORN CHUEAKAEWMANEE

342
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:47,840
It's not true.

343
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:51,680
I don't know why people are spreading 
that rumor.

344
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,760
So it's not true,
isn't it?

345
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:55,120
Definitely not true.

346
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,240
I'm confused about this too.

347
00:18:56,760 --> 00:19:00,320
My dad can be crazy,
but he's not actually that crazy.

348
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,640
Neither is mine.

349
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,560
However... from the looks of things,

350
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:09,680
there are probably going to be
a lot of students watching on match day.

351
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:11,280
It's bound to cause chaos.

352
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:13,480
Should we come up with another solution?

353
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,160
Coach Kong is right.

354
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,440
We were supposed to keep this quiet.

355
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,160
Isn't that right?

356
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,920
And if we postpone the match,

357
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:22,200
I don't think we'll be able to submit
the players' names in time.

358
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:24,360
So I think we should find another solution,

359
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:27,120
or just cancel the match altogether.

360
00:19:31,800 --> 00:19:33,760
But now...

361
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,680
my shoulder has fully healed.

362
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:38,520
Should we...

363
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:41,680
hold the match this Friday instead?

364
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,560
-Huh?
-Huh?

365
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:46,480
Yeah, that's fine.

366
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,560
Are you okay with that, Bay?

367
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,920
Yes, ma'am. Perfect.

368
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:57,920
This Friday.

369
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,520
Let’s go see a doctor, Bay.

370
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,680
No, I’m okay.

371
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:35,400
I was just practicing in the sun 
for too long.

372
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:42,720
Let’s see a doctor.

373
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:44,160
You’re still running a fever.

374
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:48,760
No, I’m not on my deathbed.

375
00:20:51,320 --> 00:20:52,200
Look,

376
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,720
when it comes to someone you love,

377
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:59,440
you can’t help but worry
even over a slight sickness.

378
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,360
Umm.

379
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:03,080
Yes, Mom.

380
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,160
Go to sleep. 

381
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:17,320
Good night, Mom.

382
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:31,600
GOT A FEVER RIGHT BEFORE THE MATCH

383
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:39,720
TWELVE BAKERY (PING)

384
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:51,520
What are you doing?

385
00:22:05,040 --> 00:22:05,760
Is this for Bay?

386
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:14,720
Come on.

387
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:19,600
Don’t worry.

388
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:20,040
Come.

389
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,760
This is Bay’s room.

390
00:22:27,760 --> 00:22:28,720
Go, get in.

391
00:22:29,280 --> 00:22:29,960
Hurry, get in.

392
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,400
Just go.

393
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:36,120
Actually, you should give this to Bay.

394
00:22:36,600 --> 00:22:37,800
You get in there.

395
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:39,040
Text me when you’re done.

396
00:22:39,040 --> 00:22:39,880
I’ll keep watch outside.

397
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,600
Don’t worry.

398
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:41,360
Go, go.

399
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:42,440
Huh?

400
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:43,840
Hey!

401
00:23:28,600 --> 00:23:31,160
Mmm, Mom?

402
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:32,840
Hey!

403
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:33,760
Shhh.

404
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,720
What are you doing here?

405
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,560
Well, Boat posted a story of you 
being sick.

406
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:50,680
When it comes to my business,
he overshares.

407
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:54,680
Are you okay?

408
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:57,600
You wanna put off the match?

409
00:24:00,840 --> 00:24:02,640
I just have a heat fever.

410
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,520
You came all the way to my house?

411
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:10,040
You’re worried about me that much?

412
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:14,560
I’m not worried about you.

413
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,240
I’m just being a good sport.

414
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,960
Am I still running a fever?

415
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,000
Mmm.

416
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,960
You’re still hot.

417
00:24:58,840 --> 00:24:59,640
Show me your forehead.

418
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:01,760
Do it for me.

419
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:20,720
You look just like my mom
when she wipes me down.

420
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:33,520
If you don’t feel better,

421
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:39,520
I’m not competing with you.

422
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:42,800
Is this you being a good sport again?

423
00:25:48,760 --> 00:25:50,040
So if you lose,

424
00:25:53,200 --> 00:25:54,760
you can’t use being sick as an excuse.

425
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,480
I still have…

426
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,240
a few more.

427
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:05,480
While I’m not here, put on a new one

428
00:26:07,560 --> 00:26:09,160
so you can put up a good fight.

429
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,720
Or you’ll get completely beaten by me.

430
00:26:12,840 --> 00:26:14,880
Go home, cocky.

431
00:26:16,560 --> 00:26:17,360
Go to sleep.

432
00:26:35,480 --> 00:26:38,600
MATCH DAY

433
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:54,000
The hell are you looking at?

434
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,120
Nothing.

435
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:58,720
Just checking if your shoulder is healed.

436
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:01,800
The match is about to begin
and you’re just asking me now?

437
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:08,800
Hey!

438
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,200
What is this?

439
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:12,720
Let me touch it.

440
00:27:13,080 --> 00:27:14,360
Touch what?

441
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,000
What’s wrong with you?

442
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:16,920
Are you a doctor?

443
00:27:18,320 --> 00:27:19,280
I’m not a doctor.

444
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:21,120
I just wanna touch it.

445
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:27,240
Does it hurt here?

446
00:27:28,600 --> 00:27:29,800
I told you it doesn’t hurt anymore.

447
00:27:30,280 --> 00:27:31,200
Mmm.

448
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:33,320
Okay.

449
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,280
I can still remember, too.

450
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:41,440
Hmm?

451
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:43,640
What?

452
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:44,920
Nothing.

453
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:46,280
See you at the court.

454
00:28:10,120 --> 00:28:11,400
Sh*t, damn it!

455
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:12,880
I knew it!

456
00:28:25,280 --> 00:28:26,640
(I can still remember, too.)

457
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:39,800
What’s the point of telling me now?

458
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:53,560
Bay.

459
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:55,640
Dad.

460
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,120
Good evening.

461
00:28:57,120 --> 00:28:57,840
Hi.

462
00:29:00,800 --> 00:29:01,960
Good evening. Good evening.

463
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:06,920
You’re late and still acting like it’s nothing.

464
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:08,240
Hmph!

465
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:10,760
What, Chun?

466
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:12,360
How am I late?

467
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,560
They said 1 p.m. and I arrived at 1 p.m.

468
00:29:13,560 --> 00:29:14,280
How am I late?

469
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:14,840
Hey.

470
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:18,400
A well-mannered person should arrive 
a little early. 

471
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:19,800
And more importantly, 

472
00:29:19,800 --> 00:29:21,280
today is your son’s big day.

473
00:29:21,280 --> 00:29:23,800
As his father, you should know 
how to behave.

474
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:25,600
Oh, what a well-mannered guy.

475
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:27,360
Let me tell you,

476
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:29,120
I had tons of orders at the shop,

477
00:29:29,840 --> 00:29:31,200
and I’m a father.

478
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:32,280
I know that…

479
00:29:32,360 --> 00:29:33,640
-Making money for the family…
-Let’s go, honey.

480
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,800
-is the most important thing.
-That’s enough, honey.

481
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:37,640
-Not like you. Your shop…
-Let’s go find our seats.

482
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:39,720
How many shumai can your shop 
even sell in a day?

483
00:29:39,800 --> 00:29:40,560
Damn.

484
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,720
Just excuses.

485
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:47,040
You tried your best.

486
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,400
It is what it is.

487
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:53,040
Can we start, Coach Kong?

488
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,120
All right, sir.

489
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:55,840
Umm…

490
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,760
Bay, you’re ready?

491
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:58,520
I’m ready.

492
00:29:58,800 --> 00:29:59,720
And Sun?

493
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:00,880
Just a sec, Coach.

494
00:30:02,760 --> 00:30:04,880
If it’s too much, you can tell me.

495
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:06,480
They’re here!

496
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:08,880
Mom!

497
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:12,760
Hello, Pa.

498
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:16,960
Hello.

499
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:19,040
I know about all of this.

500
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:20,760
I’m here to support you.

501
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:21,840
Do your best.

502
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:23,080
Yes, Mom.

503
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,320
Even if you lose, it’s okay.

504
00:30:27,520 --> 00:30:29,600
If the shop closes, 
you can come live with me.

505
00:30:48,360 --> 00:30:49,080
Heads or tails?

506
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:51,960
Heads.

507
00:30:52,560 --> 00:30:53,200
So you’re tails?

508
00:30:58,320 --> 00:30:58,640
Choose.

509
00:30:59,080 --> 00:30:59,600
I’ll serve.

510
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:01,680
I’ll take this court.

511
00:31:02,560 --> 00:31:02,960
Go!

512
00:31:26,280 --> 00:31:27,200
Go, go, Sun!
GREAT SWING, GREAT SCORES

513
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,040
Go, Sun, go, Sun!!
SAMING PHON FAI

514
00:31:28,040 --> 00:31:28,800
Go, Sun, go, Sun!!
ALL SUPERIOR!

515
00:31:28,800 --> 00:31:30,440
Go, Bay, go.
SWING HARD! SHOW THEM
WHAT MERLION CAN DO!

516
00:31:30,560 --> 00:31:31,920
Let’s do this.

517
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:33,440
Go, go, go.

518
00:31:43,320 --> 00:31:44,560
Sun, go, Sun!!

519
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:46,160
Sun, go, Sun.

520
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:47,400
Yay!!

521
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,400
Again.

522
00:31:50,560 --> 00:31:50,960
That’s it.

523
00:31:54,040 --> 00:31:54,720
You got this.

524
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:10,040
Yeah!

525
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,000
Yes!
GREAT SWING, GREAT SCORES
SAMING PHON FAI
ALL SUPERIOR!

526
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:15,240
Yay!!

527
00:32:15,280 --> 00:32:16,800
It’s okay, Bay.

528
00:32:17,560 --> 00:32:18,480
Try again.

529
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,760
Relax. Focus.

530
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:23,480
Yay!!

531
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,120
Amazing!

532
00:32:58,920 --> 00:32:59,720
Damn it.

533
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:00,600
Yes!

534
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:02,800
Yay!!

535
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,520
That’s amazing, Bay!

536
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:05,520
-Woo!
-Yay!

537
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:06,880
That’s my boy.

538
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:07,720
I’m so back.

539
00:33:08,120 --> 00:33:11,120
Show them what we’re made of, Bay.

540
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:16,640
What are you so happy about, huh?

541
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:17,960
It’s just one score.

542
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:22,160
The first point on the road 
to your downfall, Chun!!

543
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:24,200
Honey.

544
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,160
Okay, honey, okay.

545
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:29,600
Sun, go, Sun!!

546
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:32,960
Let’s go!!

547
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:03,000
Yay!!

548
00:34:03,520 --> 00:34:04,720
Amazing!!

549
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:07,640
That’s it! How about that?!

550
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:08,880
Yes!

551
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:20,040
It’s okay, Bay. It’s okay.

552
00:34:20,040 --> 00:34:21,080
It’s just the first set.

553
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:25,400
GREAT SWING, GREAT SCORES
SAMING PHON FAI
ALL SUPERIOR!

554
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:25,960
Take this.

555
00:34:28,720 --> 00:34:30,080
You did well.

556
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:34,840
Boat, go check on him.

557
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:35,920
Don’t make me come down there.

558
00:34:36,520 --> 00:34:37,280
Okay, Dad.

559
00:34:49,120 --> 00:34:49,960
Well done, Sun.

560
00:34:50,720 --> 00:34:52,280
Just keep your focus.

561
00:34:52,360 --> 00:34:54,120
The opponent will eventually get tired.

562
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:55,760
Are you okay?

563
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:57,640
Just relax.

564
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:58,680
Breathe in and out slowly.

565
00:34:59,120 --> 00:34:59,720
Drink some water.

566
00:35:01,200 --> 00:35:02,120
Don’t worry.

567
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:03,600
If you lose, that’s fine.

568
00:35:04,040 --> 00:35:05,480
I’ll talk to Dad and Mom.

569
00:35:06,080 --> 00:35:07,240
You’ll get to study abroad anyway.

570
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:09,920
I’m not really afraid of him.

571
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,040
Besides,

572
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:14,320
I’m starting to figure out his game too.

573
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:15,760
Good.

574
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:19,640
Here.

575
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:20,840
Have some water.

576
00:35:21,960 --> 00:35:22,560
Thank you.

577
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:28,280
Ready?

578
00:35:30,200 --> 00:35:30,680
Ready.

579
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:31,800
Ready?

580
00:35:32,240 --> 00:35:33,360
-Get ready.
-Yes.

581
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:37,680
If you’re ready, let’s continue.

582
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:40,640
Ready?

583
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,440
You got this?

584
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:46,640
Yes, Pa.

585
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:47,920
Do your best.

586
00:35:48,560 --> 00:35:48,920
Go!

587
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:55,480
Go, Sun.

588
00:36:07,160 --> 00:36:08,240
Concentrate.

589
00:36:13,840 --> 00:36:14,480
Yes!!

590
00:36:18,200 --> 00:36:18,720
Good.

591
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,880
It’s been almost an hour.

592
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,320
Game.

593
00:36:37,720 --> 00:36:38,320
Tie-break.

594
00:36:38,720 --> 00:36:40,440
SWING HARD! SHOW THEM
WHAT MERLION CAN DO!

595
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:41,960
GREAT SWING, GREAT SCORES
SAMING PHON FAI
ALL SUPERIOR!

596
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:01,800
Oww! Sht.

597
00:37:02,480 --> 00:37:02,840
Yes!

598
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:04,440
Great job, Bay.

599
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:05,520
Great job, Bay.

600
00:37:05,520 --> 00:37:06,720
That’s my son.

601
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:07,800
See?

602
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:13,480
Oww.

603
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:14,360
Woo!

604
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:24,120
Hold this.

605
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:25,760
I’ll check on him.

606
00:37:29,120 --> 00:37:29,960
How is it?

607
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:30,480
Are you okay?

608
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:31,600
I think so.

609
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:32,920
What?

610
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:33,960
Is there something wrong, 
Coach Kong?

611
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:37,400
Umm,
it’s getting late now.

612
00:37:37,640 --> 00:37:40,200
And they’ve been playing for so long.

613
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,360
So I think

614
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:44,840
we should put this on pause
and continue another day?

615
00:37:45,160 --> 00:37:45,480
Hey.

616
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:46,240
Eh?

617
00:37:47,560 --> 00:37:49,040
We’re in the middle of the match?

618
00:37:49,040 --> 00:37:50,280
Why are we stopping now?

619
00:37:50,600 --> 00:37:51,000
Huh?

620
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,040
They’re in a flow.

621
00:37:52,040 --> 00:37:52,960
Just let them play.

622
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:53,360
Yeah.

623
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:55,400
Besides,

624
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:57,520
I don’t have time to come watch 
another game.

625
00:37:57,680 --> 00:37:58,960
I have a business to run.

626
00:37:59,680 --> 00:38:02,400
Look, Coach Kong,
Sun has done this before.

627
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,920
He’s been in a match that was 
longer than this.

628
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:04,680
Umm, but…

629
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:07,880
this match is different.

630
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:08,640
I mean…

631
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:10,520
What?

632
00:38:12,040 --> 00:38:12,720
Oh, well…

633
00:38:13,520 --> 00:38:16,120
they both seem more exhausted 
than they usually do.

634
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:19,000
So I think they should have some rest.

635
00:38:19,240 --> 00:38:19,760
Huh?

636
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:21,680
Isn’t this normal?

637
00:38:22,920 --> 00:38:24,600
Sun, are you okay?

638
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:26,400
Yes, Pa.

639
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:26,920
Yeah.

640
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:28,320
He said he’s okay.

641
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,240
What about you, Bay?

642
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:30,360
I’m fine.

643
00:38:32,640 --> 00:38:33,280
You’re sure?

644
00:38:33,520 --> 00:38:34,320
-Yes, Coach.
-Yes, Coach.

645
00:38:36,280 --> 00:38:36,880
Okay.

646
00:38:37,680 --> 00:38:39,760
Then… let’s continue.

647
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:40,840
Okay, go.

648
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:41,520
Give it your best shot.

649
00:38:41,520 --> 00:38:42,040
Go, go.

650
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:42,760
Get him.

651
00:38:46,640 --> 00:38:48,120
Go, go, go, go.

652
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:04,360
Fault!

653
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:07,160
Wow.

654
00:39:10,720 --> 00:39:11,520
Hey, are you all right?

655
00:39:12,560 --> 00:39:13,080
Bay,

656
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:25,280
you okay?

657
00:39:26,680 --> 00:39:27,520
I’m okay.

658
00:39:55,520 --> 00:39:57,000
Sun, go, Sun!

659
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:04,560
Yeah!

660
00:40:05,720 --> 00:40:06,200
Good.

661
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:08,640
Come on.

662
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:09,880
Hang in there.

663
00:40:13,160 --> 00:40:14,520
Concentrate.

664
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:27,480
That’s right.

665
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,240
SAMING PHON FAI

666
00:42:14,240 --> 00:42:14,840
Ahem.

667
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:16,320
Ahem.

668
00:42:23,720 --> 00:42:24,120
Hey!

669
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:26,120
Hey!

670
00:42:26,640 --> 00:42:27,240
Hang on.

671
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:29,360
What do you want now?

672
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,720
Thank you.

673
00:42:35,640 --> 00:42:36,240
For what?

674
00:42:36,720 --> 00:42:38,040
Oh, please.

675
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:39,840
Don’t act nonchalant.

676
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:40,520
Bring it.

677
00:42:48,720 --> 00:42:49,080
Sh*t.

678
00:42:49,840 --> 00:42:50,440
What if he sees us?

679
00:42:52,040 --> 00:42:53,400
What if my dad sees us?

680
00:42:54,760 --> 00:42:55,800
You’ll make me stink too.

681
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:01,640
Go, go! 

682
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:06,520
You’re back?

683
00:43:09,240 --> 00:43:10,520
How was your meeting with your friends?

684
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:12,000
It was fine, Dad.

685
00:43:13,880 --> 00:43:14,680
Hey, wait, wait, wait.

686
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:16,720
Where did you go?

687
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:18,640
Why do you smell musty?

688
00:43:19,920 --> 00:43:21,040
Umm…

689
00:43:23,040 --> 00:43:26,320
Oh,
I stopped to play with a dog.

690
00:43:29,080 --> 00:43:29,880
What dog?

691
00:43:30,960 --> 00:43:31,600
You wanna keep a dog?

692
00:43:31,600 --> 00:43:32,200
Oh, no.

693
00:43:33,080 --> 00:43:33,880
No, Dad.

694
00:43:34,080 --> 00:43:36,000
It was just a stray dog.

695
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:37,760
(Stray dog?)

696
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:39,080
It was cute.

697
00:43:42,600 --> 00:43:43,520
Hey, wait!

698
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:45,560
Don’t get on the bed in that outfit.

699
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:47,520
You’ll make the bed smell.

700
00:43:48,480 --> 00:43:49,200
Yes, Pa.

701
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:52,480
SAMING PHON FAI

702
00:44:12,280 --> 00:44:12,960
-Bay!

703
00:44:13,760 --> 00:44:15,880
-Do you realize you’re acting 
super weird?

704
00:44:15,960 --> 00:44:16,560
-How?

705
00:44:22,080 --> 00:44:22,720
-Well, you…

706
00:44:23,960 --> 00:44:25,360
-You act like you care about me.

707
00:44:30,760 --> 00:44:31,640
-Just answer me.

708
00:44:32,240 --> 00:44:33,480
-Why did you hug me?

709
00:44:36,360 --> 00:44:37,760
-The question you asked me,

710
00:44:39,280 --> 00:44:41,160
-I’d like to know the answer too.

711
00:44:42,360 --> 00:44:45,640
